              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="5">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Prepare and launch a container-based OpenLB wind simulation (Smagorinsky LES, time-averaged pedestrian wind field). Uses the same ABL inflow object as the OpenFOAM and FluidX3D engines. Needs Docker Desktop or podman; the solver image is pulled on first run.

Version 1.6.0.827

Version 1.6.0.827

Version 1.6.0.827

Version 1.6.0.827</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">9feea9c5-f16e-4ea5-8345-fbc3eee83fc9</item>
